{"id":"1c2b52ae52bf94f2","group":"28","path":"28/28-df-kw-relation.md","title":"Karchmer-Wigderson Search Relation","display":"df-kw-relation — Karchmer-Wigderson Search Relation","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-df-kw-relation","aliases":["28-df-kw-relation"],"display":"df-kw-relation — Karchmer-Wigderson Search Relation","depends_on":[],"source_reference":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach, §14.5.4 before Theorem 14.16","source_printed_pages":"302–303","source_pdf_pages":"328–329","source_statement_verified":true,"source_proof_reviewed":false,"verification_status":"proved-in-note","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-df-kw-relation"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-df-kw-relation</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-kw-relation — Karchmer-Wigderson Search Relation"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<span class=\"property-null\">无</span>"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach, §14.5.4 before Theorem 14.16"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"302–303"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"328–329"},{"key":"source_statement_verified","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_reviewed","html":"false"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f:\\{0,1\\}^n\\to\\{0,1\\}\">\\(f:\\{0,1\\}^n\\to\\{0,1\\}\\)</span> 为非常值函数；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X=f^{-1}(\\{0\\}),Y=f^{-1}(\\{1\\})\">\\(X=f^{-1}(\\{0\\}),Y=f^{-1}(\\{1\\})\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}\">\\(\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h\\preceq s\">\\(h\\preceq s\\)</span> 表示前缀，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\epsilon\">\\(\\epsilon\\)</span> 为空串。</li>\n<li>协议候选是完整元组 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pi=(T,\\lambda,a,b,\\ell)\">\\(\\Pi=(T,\\lambda,a,b,\\ell)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\subseteq\\Sigma^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(T\\subseteq\\Sigma^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a_h:X\\to\\Sigma,b_h:Y\\to\\Sigma\">\\(a_h:X\\to\\Sigma,b_h:Y\\to\\Sigma\\)</span> 是各内节点的发送函数；叶索引输出免费。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C_{\\mathrm{KW}}\">\\(C_{\\mathrm{KW}}\\)</span> 的下标KW标识本搜索关系模型。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>下式 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L(T),J(T)\">\\(L(T),J(T)\\)</span> 对有限树候选定义，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d(T)\">\\(d(T)\\)</span> 限于有限非空 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span>；执行、停止时刻与输出限于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pi\\in\\mathscr P_{X,Y,n}\">\\(\\Pi\\in\\mathscr P_{X,Y,n}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in X\">\\(x\\in X\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y\\in Y\">\\(y\\in Y\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"L(T)\\coloneqq\\{h\\in T:h0\\notin T\\land h1\\notin T\\},\\qquad J(T)\\coloneqq T\\setminus L(T),\\qquad d(T)\\coloneqq\\max_{h\\in T}|h|.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[L(T)\\coloneqq\\{h\\in T:h0\\notin T\\land h1\\notin T\\},\\qquad J(T)\\coloneqq T\\setminus L(T),\\qquad d(T)\\coloneqq\\max_{h\\in T}|h|.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathscr P_{X,Y,n}\\coloneqq\\{(T,\\lambda,a,b,\\ell):\\;&amp;T\\subseteq\\Sigma^{&lt;\\omega},\\ |T|&lt;\\aleph_0,\\ \\epsilon\\in T,\\ \\forall s\\in T\\ \\forall h\\preceq s\\ h\\in T,\\\\\n&amp;\\forall h\\in J(T)\\ \\{h0,h1\\}\\subseteq T,\\ \\lambda:J(T)\\to\\{0,1\\},\\\\\n&amp;a\\in\\prod_{h\\in J(T)}\\Sigma^X,\\ b\\in\\prod_{h\\in J(T)}\\Sigma^Y,\\ \\ell:L(T)\\to[n]\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathscr P_{X,Y,n}\\coloneqq\\{(T,\\lambda,a,b,\\ell):\\;&amp;T\\subseteq\\Sigma^{&lt;\\omega},\\ |T|&lt;\\aleph_0,\\ \\epsilon\\in T,\\ \\forall s\\in T\\ \\forall h\\preceq s\\ h\\in T,\\\\\n&amp;\\forall h\\in J(T)\\ \\{h0,h1\\}\\subseteq T,\\ \\lambda:J(T)\\to\\{0,1\\},\\\\\n&amp;a\\in\\prod_{h\\in J(T)}\\Sigma^X,\\ b\\in\\prod_{h\\in J(T)}\\Sigma^Y,\\ \\ell:L(T)\\to[n]\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"h_0^{\\Pi,x,y}\\coloneqq\\epsilon,\\qquad h_{t+1}^{\\Pi,x,y}\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}h_t^{\\Pi,x,y}&amp;h_t^{\\Pi,x,y}\\in L(T),\\\\h_t^{\\Pi,x,y}a_{h_t^{\\Pi,x,y}}(x)&amp;h_t^{\\Pi,x,y}\\in J(T),\\ \\lambda(h_t^{\\Pi,x,y})=0,\\\\h_t^{\\Pi,x,y}b_{h_t^{\\Pi,x,y}}(y)&amp;h_t^{\\Pi,x,y}\\in J(T),\\ \\lambda(h_t^{\\Pi,x,y})=1.\\end{cases}\\quad(t\\in\\mathbb N).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[h_0^{\\Pi,x,y}\\coloneqq\\epsilon,\\qquad h_{t+1}^{\\Pi,x,y}\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}h_t^{\\Pi,x,y}&amp;h_t^{\\Pi,x,y}\\in L(T),\\\\h_t^{\\Pi,x,y}a_{h_t^{\\Pi,x,y}}(x)&amp;h_t^{\\Pi,x,y}\\in J(T),\\ \\lambda(h_t^{\\Pi,x,y})=0,\\\\h_t^{\\Pi,x,y}b_{h_t^{\\Pi,x,y}}(y)&amp;h_t^{\\Pi,x,y}\\in J(T),\\ \\lambda(h_t^{\\Pi,x,y})=1.\\end{cases}\\quad(t\\in\\mathbb N).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"t_\\Pi(x,y)\\coloneqq\\min\\{t\\in\\mathbb N:h_t^{\\Pi,x,y}\\in L(T)\\},\\qquad o_\\Pi(x,y)\\coloneqq\\ell(h_{t_\\Pi(x,y)}^{\\Pi,x,y}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[t_\\Pi(x,y)\\coloneqq\\min\\{t\\in\\mathbb N:h_t^{\\Pi,x,y}\\in L(T)\\},\\qquad o_\\Pi(x,y)\\coloneqq\\ell(h_{t_\\Pi(x,y)}^{\\Pi,x,y}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{KW}_f\\coloneqq\\{(x,y,i)\\in X\\times Y\\times[n]:x_i\\ne y_i\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{KW}_f\\coloneqq\\{(x,y,i)\\in X\\times Y\\times[n]:x_i\\ne y_i\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"C_{\\mathrm{KW}}(f)\\coloneqq\\min\\{d(T):\\Pi=(T,\\lambda,a,b,\\ell)\\in\\mathscr P_{X,Y,n},\\ \\forall(x,y)\\in X\\times Y\\ (x,y,o_\\Pi(x,y))\\in\\operatorname{KW}_f\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[C_{\\mathrm{KW}}(f)\\coloneqq\\min\\{d(T):\\Pi=(T,\\lambda,a,b,\\ell)\\in\\mathscr P_{X,Y,n},\\ \\forall(x,y)\\in X\\times Y\\ (x,y,o_\\Pi(x,y))\\in\\operatorname{KW}_f\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>非常函数使X,Y非空且任意异值输入必有不同坐标；逐位公开输入给有限正确协议。此关系协议的叶索引不收费，明确区别前文末位输出计费的布尔函数协议，否则精确深度等式会多出编码成本。</p>\n<p>来源：§14.5.4 before Theorem 14.16；印刷页 302–303；PDF 页 328–329。来源为本任务提供的605页本地PDF。</p>\n<p>R5新建理由：补足第14章的 Karchmer-Wigderson Search Relation，查重范围为本书目录的全部既有原子文件名、MOC及相邻相关定义全文；未读取其他书籍原子，全部声明依赖留在28目录。</p>\n<p>本次形式修补：历史到达叶后保持不变，因而在全部自然数时刻都有定义；有限树保证停止时刻集合非空。首达叶、免费叶标签输出和通信深度均保持原值。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}","display":false},{"tex":"f:\\{0,1\\}^n\\to\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"X=f^{-1}(\\{0\\}),Y=f^{-1}(\\{1\\})","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"h\\preceq s","display":false},{"tex":"\\epsilon","display":false},{"tex":"\\Pi=(T,\\lambda,a,b,\\ell)","display":false},{"tex":"T\\subseteq\\Sigma^{<\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"a_h:X\\to\\Sigma,b_h:Y\\to\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"C_{\\mathrm{KW}}","display":false},{"tex":"L(T),J(T)","display":false},{"tex":"d(T)","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"\\Pi\\in\\mathscr P_{X,Y,n}","display":false},{"tex":"x\\in X","display":false},{"tex":"y\\in Y","display":false},{"tex":"L(T)\\coloneqq\\{h\\in T:h0\\notin T\\land h1\\notin T\\},\\qquad J(T)\\coloneqq T\\setminus L(T),\\qquad d(T)\\coloneqq\\max_{h\\in T}|h|.","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathscr P_{X,Y,n}\\coloneqq\\{(T,\\lambda,a,b,\\ell):\\;&T\\subseteq\\Sigma^{<\\omega},\\ |T|<\\aleph_0,\\ \\epsilon\\in T,\\ \\forall s\\in T\\ \\forall h\\preceq s\\ h\\in T,\\\\\n&\\forall h\\in J(T)\\ \\{h0,h1\\}\\subseteq T,\\ \\lambda:J(T)\\to\\{0,1\\},\\\\\n&a\\in\\prod_{h\\in J(T)}\\Sigma^X,\\ b\\in\\prod_{h\\in J(T)}\\Sigma^Y,\\ \\ell:L(T)\\to[n]\\}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"h_0^{\\Pi,x,y}\\coloneqq\\epsilon,\\qquad h_{t+1}^{\\Pi,x,y}\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}h_t^{\\Pi,x,y}&h_t^{\\Pi,x,y}\\in L(T),\\\\h_t^{\\Pi,x,y}a_{h_t^{\\Pi,x,y}}(x)&h_t^{\\Pi,x,y}\\in J(T),\\ \\lambda(h_t^{\\Pi,x,y})=0,\\\\h_t^{\\Pi,x,y}b_{h_t^{\\Pi,x,y}}(y)&h_t^{\\Pi,x,y}\\in J(T),\\ \\lambda(h_t^{\\Pi,x,y})=1.\\end{cases}\\quad(t\\in\\mathbb N).","display":true},{"tex":"t_\\Pi(x,y)\\coloneqq\\min\\{t\\in\\mathbb N:h_t^{\\Pi,x,y}\\in L(T)\\},\\qquad o_\\Pi(x,y)\\coloneqq\\ell(h_{t_\\Pi(x,y)}^{\\Pi,x,y}).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{KW}_f\\coloneqq\\{(x,y,i)\\in X\\times Y\\times[n]:x_i\\ne y_i\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"C_{\\mathrm{KW}}(f)\\coloneqq\\min\\{d(T):\\Pi=(T,\\lambda,a,b,\\ell)\\in\\mathscr P_{X,Y,n},\\ \\forall(x,y)\\in X\\times Y\\ (x,y,o_\\Pi(x,y))\\in\\operatorname{KW}_f\\}.","display":true}],"bytes":3222,"backlinks":[{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-349","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[28-df-mod-m-circuit]]、[[28-thm-razborov-smolensky]]、[[28-df-monotone-circuit]]、[[28-df-kw-relation]]、[[28-thm-kw-depth]]。"},{"id":"1252c388e907bf3d","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$f:\\{0,1\\}^n\\to\\{0,1\\}$ 非常，$n\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}$；$C_{\\mathrm{KW}}(f)$ 见 [[28-df-kw-relation]]。"}],"outgoing":[]}